rule late_flag v1
description "Flags a return as late from the day it is due, which may be missing. The table writes one row, for the days before July: it covers neither the rest of the year nor a return with no day"

inputs
  due : date?  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-12-31

outputs
  late : bool

table pick
policy unique
| due         | -> late : bool |
| <2026-07-01 | false          |
